        <mxCell id="footer" value="AWS target below £50/month, excluding Twelve Data and Claude API. Prices require regional confirmation.&#10;Single-host availability accepted. No ALB, NAT Gateway, RDS, GPU, managed Redis or automatic deployment.&#10;1 November 2026 | Conceptual flows, not live activity | Personal use only - no trading" vertex="1" parent="1" style="fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#17243C;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;text;align=left;fontSize=17;">
